2097
01:58:45,890 --> 01:58:49,570
I still remember walking into class one day and seeing

2098
01:58:49,650 --> 01:58:56,050
Qadiani Kafir written boldly across the blackboard by a student no older than thirteen or fourteen year old.

2099
01:58:56,130 --> 01:59:02,130
